                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>The objective of this course is to train the students to get solid foundation of the knowledge and operational capacity, strong ability of innovation and great development potential. The internship program is the supplement of the theoretical courses.This course is designed to recognize the relationship between clinical anatomy, physiologic function and causation of diseases. Knowing the diagnosis and treatment of common otorhinolaryngology diseases.</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
